                     <description>Sudden loss or diminution of muscle tone without apparent preceding myoclonic or tonic event lasting greater or equal to 1 to 2 s, involving head, trunk, jaw, or limb musculature. (Source: Beniczky ea 2017, Table 10; Beniczky ea 2013, Appendix S5.)</description>
